WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:05.210
I let Ragna Infinity attack Soul Marionetter!

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.090
Durbe, our foe is struck down.

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.560
I was only able to win, 
thanks to the power you gave me.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.700
Looks like that isn't the case.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.220
Merag!!

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:33.970
What... how did you -- !?

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:40.480
I activated the other effect 
of "Don Thousand's Throne"!

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:43.960
When an Xyz Monster with higher ATK than my life points

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:47.170
attacks my Xyz-Monster,

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:51.350
I can send the "Don Thousand's Throne" equipped to me to the Graveyard

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:54.820
to negate that battle and end your turn!

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:57.310
Such an effect is...

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:00.610
Not yet! The effect hasn't finished yet!

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:01.800
What!?

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.840
Its final super effect, you see...

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:08.290
... is Ranking Up the attacked monster, 
infusing it with the essence of Chaos!

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:10.290
Wha... Say what!?

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:16.150
I Chaos Xyz Change my Soul Marrionetter!

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:22.750
Appear! Chaos Number 43!

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:30.140
The Soul-Puppetteering Ogre-Esque Deity, Chaos Marionetter!

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:35.550
{marker}

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:39.730
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:44.970
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:56.660
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:01:57.020 --> 00:02:00.840
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:07.660
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:11.640
the feelings I want to express.

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:20.660
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:23.910
Right now, with you

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:27.840
Oh - By facing each other,

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:34.920
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:40.020
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:45.450
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:50.620
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:02:51.520 --> 00:03:00.200
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:11.000
No cabin pressure abnormalities.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:13.500
<i>A Goodbye Is Only for a Moment... 
The Sad Fate of the Siblings</i>

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.170
One more Photon Mile to the Lunar Surface.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:18.420
This is the birthplace of the Galaxy-Eyes...

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:24.140
My Galaxy-Eyes ... 
Is this...?!

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:31.980
The in ... inst ... instru ... instruments!
Diagnosis impossible! All systems are non-responsive!

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.610
What the...?!

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:46.030
Change! Astrosuit Mode!

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:55.790
What's this...?!

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:11.640
Why did you use that Spell Card to turn your monsters

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:14.480
from Warrior-Type into Beast-Type?

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:18.110
I don't know what you're up to...

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:21.570
but what can you do anyway, 
now that you lost all your powers as a Barian?

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.860
- Alit... 
- This is bad...

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:27.660
No. His aim probably is, to...

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:29.950
Here I come, Gilag!

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:35.500
I Overlay both of my Big Bandages,
who are treated as Beast-Types!

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.130
Xyz Summon!

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:43.220
Show yourself, Number 64!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.140
Ronin Raccoon Sanday!

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:53.020
That's...!? My Ruin's Number!

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:03.240
<i>Po... Po... Po... Po... PON</i>!

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:06.990
Yo... you're...?!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.450
The Spirit of his Number, Ponta,
is on the scene~<i>pon</i>!

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:13.290
- Ponta! 
- You're okay!

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.460
You are Ponta?

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:19.130
Then lend me your power, so we
can beat the crazy out of that guy!

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.460
Leave it to me! Pon!

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.710
Then let's do this! Ponta!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.850
I activate the effect of
Ronin Raccoon Sandayu!

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:31.560
By using one it's Overlay Units,

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:36.190
I can Special Summon a "Kaegmusha Raccoon Token"!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:41.360
Then my Kagemusha Token's Attack becomes equal to

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:45.280
the Attack of the monster with 
the highest Attack on the field!

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:49.070
That means your "Giant Hand Red"

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.030
with its 2600 Attack!

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:52.790
Gilag...

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:57.160
My Kagemusha attacks your Giant Red Hand!

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:59.830
Have you gone mad!?

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:05.630
Even if they have the same attack,
Numbers can only be destroyed by another Number!

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.340
I'm doing that on purpose!

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:11.640
What you mean?

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:16.480
Here goes! Counter Trap, "Last Counter", activate!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.480
When my monster is destroyed in battle...

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:23.400
The opponent's monster that destroyed it has its Attack become 0,

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:28.950
and my Number gains Attack
equal to the Attack it lost!

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.780
It's got 3600 Attack!?

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:35.750
Awesome! If the Number from the Ruins
beats the Over Hundred Number,

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.790
Gilag's curse will be broken!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:42.170
Go! Ronin Raccoon Sandayu!

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:45.000
Attack "Giant Red Hand"!

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.170
Now, Gilag, my Lord, let' go~<i>pon</i>!

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:04.020
Remember them, Gilag!

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:06.690
Your true memories!

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:14.330
I shall rewrite your destiny.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.120
Wha... what the!?

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:20.210
The thought of betrayal by your friends
shall be the thorn of your miserable death

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:24.420
and beset with anger and sadness,
you will go to the Barian World...

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:30.090
... to become the power for my resurrection!

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:42.850
These ... are my true memories ...?

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:46.820
Gilag...

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:52.240
Now, here we go, Merag.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:55.070
My turn, draw!

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:58.950
I activate the Continuous Spell Card,
"Cursed Chaos"!

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:03.040
As long as this is activated,
you can't use your monster's effect,

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:06.460
unless you pay 500 Life Points!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:11.130
That means you can't use
Ragna Infinity's Effect anymore!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:14.720
And now, I activate my Chaos Marionetter's effect!

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:18.310
Once per turn, I can use an Chaos Overlay Unit ...

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.100
... and when my opponent controls

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:23.520
a monster with more Attack than their Life Points ...

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:26.900
I can Special Summon 1 Konpaku Token!

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.570
What!?

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:39.790
And that Token's Attack
is equal to your Life Points.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.200
And then...!

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:46.040
The Token can attack up to the number of Chaos Overlay Units attached to Chaos Marionetter!

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:49.210
Which means this one can attack <i>three</i> times!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:52.470
But it still only has 500 Attack.

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.470
It can't stand up to my monster!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.890
Then shall we give it a <i>try</i>?

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:02.220
My Konpaku Token attacks
Ragna Infinity!

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:07.980
Why would you kill 
yourself!?

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:11.530
Such a disappointment for you over again!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.150
A Konpaku Token can't be destroyed by battle...

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:17.360
... and I don't take any damage!!

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:18.820
What did you say!?

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.830
And now, the negated damage...

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:25.290
... will be added to Chaos Marionetter's Attack!

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.500
No... no way...

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.290
Now, Round 2!

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.090
Attack on Ragna Infinity!

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:43.810
Which means my Chaos Marionetter
gains <i>more</i> attack!!!

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:47.940
Now, how about the third attack?

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:51.400
Go, Konpaku Token!

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:55.110
Stop it, Vector...

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.530
I'll give you my own life...

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:01.830
So... Stop it!

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:05.450
I...

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:09.960
That's right, 'cause of Vector and Don Thousand, I was...

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.760
A... Alit!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.510
So, Don Thousand's curse on you...

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:23.640
...looks like I've finally lifted it from you.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:26.850
So all my hard work wasn't wasted...

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:29.770
You... Alit!

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:31.560
Don't come towards me!

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.820
The Duel isn't over yet!

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:38.110
There's my Trap Card, "Last Counter."

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:41.240
When the Monster that had its Attack set to Zero is destroyed...

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:42.990
... and the battle ends...

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:46.750
... the original Attack of the destroyed Monster...

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:50.040
is dealt to me as damage!

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:56.130
Impossible! But Alit... then you...!

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:00.430
Gilag, you're best bud I ever had.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:04.720
Finally we can be just like friends, right...?

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:07.220
A... Alit...

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:11.350
Yuma, Astral, and Kotori too.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:15.110
I'm sorry, I thought I could win.

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:20.400
But it's your part now to beat Don Thousand to shreds.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:24.490
With all the wounds I took here,
this is as far as I go...

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:27.330
Hey, wait a sec, Alit!

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:32.080
Yuma, meeting you... was totally hot.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.840
Alit!!

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:53.850
A-... Alit!!!

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.280
Alit!!

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:08.330
ALIT!!!!

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.160
Vector...

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:14.500
With this, my Chaos Marrionetter has...

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:17.290
18600 Attaaack!

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:20.210
Now, you ready for the <i>finish</i>?

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:25.340
Toodles, Merag!

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.470
Chaos Marionetter,

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:30.680
Attack her Ragna Infinity!

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.200
Ryouga ...

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.290
Rio ...

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:57.790
Ryouga ...

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:03.130
Our walk down the road of fate...
I am glad I was together with you.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:06.680
But, I have to say goodbye once more...

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:09.050
Please live on...

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:12.850
You have to keep on living
 and be stronger.

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:15.600
And don't forget.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:19.400
You are never alone.

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:25.530
Rio!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.700
This is goodbye, Ryouga.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.790
Rio!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:42.130
RIO!!

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:58.100
This is the end... of my destiny...

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:23.710
Ryouga, I...  wanted to be...

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.550
... just a little longer with you...

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:39.100
Now Merag and Durbe's powers belong to <i>me</i>!

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:41.190
I'm positively dripping

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.110
with power!

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.860
Just 4 lil' piggies left!

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.900
Vector.

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:49.110
Hurry to where Gilag is.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.570
We've got a problem over there.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:00.870
Master Kaito. I can confirm that
a body of energy is rapidly approaching us!

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.040
Here it comes!

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:11.090
So, you came, Mizael.

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:13.720
Yes... I heard it.

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:16.770
The howls of your Galaxy Eyes!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.430
This here...

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:21.730
It's the land of the Dragon's Legend
that Tron's sons told me about ...

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.360
What happened to V and III?

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:27.190
They were truly proud, noble brothers.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:31.280
Apparently, to buy some time for your and Yuma's journeys...

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:33.370
... they sacrificed themselves.

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.160
I see...

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:42.120
Mizael. Here is where the Key
to the Numeron Code lays dormant.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.790
The Key to the Numeron Code...

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:48.010
Just, why... Alit....

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:51.630
Just as we got to be friends, finally.

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:54.760
Why... just why did you...?

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:58.020
I was... I was Alit's...

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:06.360
Me and Alit's real memories...

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:09.150
That guy did... Don Thousand did...

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:13.950
I won't forgive this.
I'll never gonna forgive this, Don Thousand!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:15.370
Vector!

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.000
Gilag! Yuma!

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:33.880
Gilag!!!

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.600
You just had to get in the way.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.720
Though, thanks to all those useless, sappy emotions...

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:42.810
... a nice little hole formed in your heart.

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:46.400
Bad for you, 'cause this lets me to take your soul

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.020
from you, Gilag, right?!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:50.980
Vector...!

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:54.280
Hey, Gilag! Why... Why you had me...?

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:58.030
My best friend in the entire world...

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:01.410
... risked his life to protect you.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.210
So I too will...

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:05.540
You...?!

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:08.590
The rest is up to you, Yuma.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:10.420
Gilag!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.590
Gilag, your lordship!

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:18.220
I'll never leave you again~<i>pon</i>!
I'll stay by your side this time~<i>pon</i>!

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:20.010
Ponta...

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:23.560
Now, hurry up and come to me!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.400
- Gilag!
- Ponta!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:34.610
Tha... that's...

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.990
You bastard! Vector!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:40.700
The power is surging in me...

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:45.580
You know, it's like when I took
Merag and Durbe's souls just before...!

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:50.380
That's... you're lying!

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:55.720
Oh yeah, Merag... no, Rio-chan, wasn't she one of your old friends, right!?

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:57.840
...so horrible...

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.050
Vector!

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:04.560
When I've got the powers of all Seven Emperors, I'll crush you,

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:08.810
and then, with the Numeron Code, I'll be the Almighty God!

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:12.400
Vector!!!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:22.200
I'll deal with you bastards after I have squashed Nasch.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.120
It will be my pleasure, heh.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:26.200
Vector!!!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:36.720
The card with the power of God, the Numeron Code...

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.260
... it doesn't work just by itself.

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:43.430
It needs a very special key in order to work.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:47.390
That key is made from the two Galaxy-Eyes.

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:50.810
In the ruin where I fought Jinlong...

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:55.650
... I found a monolith showing the legend of the making of the Numeron Code.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:01.160
<i></i>Kaito, indeed you managed to come back again?

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:02.660
<i></i>Jinlong...?!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.990
<i></i>What lies here before you...

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:08.460
<i></i>... is the secret of how the Numeron Code
was created by a Dragon.

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:13.290
<i></i>Dragons are blessed with a much
longer life than Men.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:16.050
<i></i>Dragons are blessed with a much
longer life than Men.

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:20.800
<i></i>That is why humans revere Dragons and sometimes even fear them.

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.640
<i></i>So they were living side by side.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:27.810
<i></i>When the Universe began,
there was but one Dragon.

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:31.440
<i></i>But being all lonely just by himself,

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:34.520
<i></i>the dragon used all its power

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:37.150
<i></i>to create this Universe.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:41.820
<i></i>However, by doing this, the dragon used all of its power...

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:45.950
<i></i>...and it was on the verge of death.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.040
<i></i>The dragon was very sad about its death,

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:55.500
<i></i>because it wouldn't be able to see
the future of the Universe it created.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:01.720
<i></i>So, with the very last bit of his strength, he shed a single tear.

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:06.470
<i></i>Filled with the Dragon's emotions and knowledge,

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:11.890
<i></i>the tear was wandering the endless cosmos,
eventually reaching a certain planet.

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:15.650
<i></i>That planet was Earth.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:20.070
<i></i>And from the impact, the Moon was created.

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:23.280
<i></i>And within the Dragon's tear is...

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:24.740
<i></i>That's correct.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:28.540
<i></i>The Numeron Code is in the Earth itself.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:31.870
<i></i>And the key to it was placed on the moon.

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:35.210
<i></i>And then, anticipating this crisis,

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:38.170
<i></i>the Dragon lent the power of the Numbers...

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:41.300
<i></i>...to have it's existence hidden away.

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:47.010
<i></i>To rewrite the future and the past with the power of god,

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.600
<i></i>the Dragon cast a spell.

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:56.190
Dragons of light and time, clash at thy place of birth,

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:59.400
then shall the eyes of the galaxies truly awaken for the first time,

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.490
opening the gate of a new world.

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:04.610
That was what was written on the monolith.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:06.700
The Dragons of Light and Time.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:10.580
In other words, Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon and Tachyon Dragon.

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:16.210
Of us two fighting here, only the winner will get the Numeron Code and break it's spell,

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.710
and get their hands on it's key.

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:22.050
If that legend is true...

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:26.220
... then the two Dragons are cards
built with the power of the Barians.

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:31.060
Then the Barians are the true owners of the Numeron Code!

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:34.100
Correct. As far as it goes now.

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:36.600
Eh? What do you mean.

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:40.520
<i>That's right. On the tablet...</i>

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:44.070
<i>there was another Dragon... that was...</i>

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.990
Mizael. You'll understand if we fight!

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:51.370
I see. Interesting.

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:55.160
Then, concerning who of us is the strongest Dragon Tamer...

00:21:55.870 --> 00:21:57.290
... let's settle this here!

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:02.000
Yes, that's right, Mizael!

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:07.430
Duel!

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:10.300
{marker}

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.970
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:16.390
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:18.650
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:22.320
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:24.940
Let it go.

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:38.210
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:43.420
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:49.340
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:54.680
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.810 --> 00:22:59.520
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:05.400
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:07.570
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.570 --> 00:23:11.950
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:15.830
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:17.580
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:22.040
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:24.170
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:27.010
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:29.420
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:32.930
Challenge the GAME

00:23:41.140 --> 00:23:43.020
Following the legend on the Monolith,

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:46.520
the Dragon Tamer's Duel between Kaito and Mizael has begun.

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:50.200
Indeed, it's all about who will get
the Key to the Numeron Code.

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:53.530
No one... I couldn't help anyone at all!

00:23:53.570 --> 00:23:55.700
Could this be the monolith?

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:58.040
It is the quest for the Light of Hope.

00:23:58.240 --> 00:24:00.160
If this goes on, Kaito will...!

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:02.830
Next Time, on Yu-Gi-Oh ZEXAL II!

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:06.840
The Myth of the Revived Dragon Emperor!!
Galaxy-Eyes Prime Photon Dragon

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:09.210
That's the new Galaxy Eyes!?
